{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pulls/65","id":5002163290,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVAHcRc8AAAABKib0Wg","html_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pull/65","diff_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pull/65.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pull/65.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/issues/65","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pulls/65/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pulls/65/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/issues/65/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/statuses/0e237026c7f1f293d2b0d0e8c94255ed4597c0dc","number":65,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"test: DEV-05.0 disposable product verification and acceptance report","user":{"login":"Parikshit-Sahrawat","id":45139666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTM5NjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45139666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat","html_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"DEV-05.0 now has a disposable, baseline-pinned full-product verification harness. The recorded run against `f617cc653a965c2ad1bb7edf9e20237e40044b97` found a release-blocking UI defect: saving HEAD, latency and approved-header settings returns HTTP 200, but the form resets to GET and empty assertion fields after reload. The harness preserves that failing assertion and leaves application behavior unchanged.\n\nThe dedicated Compose stack runs PostgreSQL, API/migrations, frontend, a controlled HTTPS fixture, remote worker and Playwright. Three internal networks, no published ports, restricted synthetic credential mounts and project-scoped cleanup isolate each run. Application files are extracted from the exact baseline with `git archive`.\n\nValidation: 20 check groups PASS, 1 FAIL, 1 BLOCKED and 1 NOT TESTED. Passing coverage includes real TLS GET/HEAD, persisted metrics/logs/evidence, OPEN→RESOLVED alert identity, dashboard visibility, live Linux process monitoring, templates/collectors, tenant/worker authorization and 22 TLS/egress/negative checks. Related existing backend regressions: 63 passed and 2 explicit Contrib-binary skips; frontend: 26 passed plus lint/build. Genuine provider certification was not attempted; production deployment is prohibited.\n\nBoth normal completion despite the product failure and a deliberate post-start failure removed all project containers, networks, volumes and synthetic secret directories. An unrelated pre-existing container was preserved. No unrelated CI workflow was manually rerun.\n\nSee [acceptance report](docs/verification/dev05/ACCEPTANCE.md), [machine-readable results and redacted artifacts](docs/verification/dev05/evidence/), [failure cleanup evidence](docs/verification/dev05/failure-cleanup/) and [run instructions](verification/dev05/README.md).\n\nDraft for review: DEV05-001 must be fixed separately and the browser check rerun. Do not merge or deploy automatically.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T05:39:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:12:42Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T07:12:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T07:12:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"08e33beff5ad88d175178ca4bc02ec288a2d2058","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Parikshit-Sahrawat:test/dev-05-0-disposable-product-verification","ref":"test/dev-05-0-disposable-product-verification","repo":{"id":1409408069,"node_id":"R_kgDOVAHcRQ","name":"OpsControl_Dashboard","full_name":"Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard","owner":{"login":"Parikshit-Sahrawat","id":45139666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTM5NjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45139666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat","html_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"publi